   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- Late in set two, Stevie Wonder, spotted in the crowd, was invited onstage and sat in for this song, then All Day Sucker and Do Yourself A Favor [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2005-10-01.soulive2005-10-01** (recommended): audience recording; 0 songs; 121 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Soulive Horns joined: Rashawn Ross on trombone and Ryan Zoidis on sax [1]\n- Reggie Watts of Maktub sang on several songs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2005-10-01.soulive2005-10-01**: taped by Peter Costello; transferred by Dennis Horton; source: AUD [1]",
